1
00:00:00,907 --> 00:00:02,067
(Bernadette:)Let's think.

2
00:00:08,681 --> 00:00:11,741
Are we doing just Disney
or California Adventure too?

3
00:00:14,654 --> 00:00:18,884
(Leonard:)It's nice of your old school to let us try out
our science talk on some female students.

4
00:00:19,058 --> 00:00:22,088
They were actually pretty excited.
I'm their most famous alum.

5
00:00:22,262 --> 00:00:25,562
(Howard:)If you don't count the serial killer
who ate all those prostitutes.

6
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,260
This must feel good for you, coming
back to your alma mater as an astronaut.

7
00:00:31,438 --> 00:00:35,878
(Howard:)Yeah. Last time I was here
I was just a scrawny little nerd.

8
00:00:36,543 --> 00:00:39,103
(Leonard:)And now you're also an astronaut.

9
00:00:40,079 --> 00:00:43,449
(Howard:)So many memories.
How many times in these hallways...

10
00:00:43,616 --> 00:00:47,416
...was I tripped, punched and spit on? Heh.

11
00:00:47,587 --> 00:00:49,917
(Howard:)Oh, look, here's my old locker.

12
00:00:50,256 --> 00:00:52,416
(Howard:)I have a masters in engineering...

13
00:00:52,592 --> 00:01:02,022
(Howard:)...I still can't figure out how Scott Kapinski
got me and my briefcase to fit in there.

